#: ../../source/index.rst:35
msgid "The **Ultimate Sensor Kit** is built around the Arduino Uno R4 Minima and comes with more than 30 modules - ultrasonic, flame, accelerometer and gyroscope, pulse oximeter, and many more. Every module is paired with a beginner-friendly example, so you get the parts and the know-how."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:40
msgid "Work through the course step by step and you will go from blinking an LED to real projects: IoT projects that report to **Blynk** over Wi-Fi, Bluetooth projects controlled from your phone, and fun builds such as a smart trash can or an automatic soap dispenser."
msgstr ""

